From: Parth Thakre <144053824+parth-thakre@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 20:49:12 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] Tests and docs after the rebase: layout override
 coverage, graph mode in the MLP check, greedy metadata

- test_paged_decode_layout: default-layout assertions clear EXL3_DEC_GROUP; new override case
  (64 / 128 rows, and groups that still split past 128).
- test_gemv32: section 5 prints EXL3_GRAPHS and says when it checks the direct C++ path rather
  than capture / replay (ROCm defaults graphs off).
- test_greedy_equal: no EXL3_GDN_REPLAY / EXL3_DRAFT_ROW_BUDGET (no readers left); the metadata
  records the WMMA / attention / graph settings; cross-tree equality qualified.
- env_vars.md: EXL3_DEC_GROUP gives one program per kv head only while q_len x group <= 128.

Reviewed with GPT-6.1 Sol (Codex).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
